---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Security Posture — KOLINN_NAV" description="Detailed security implementation and threat model.">
  <main id="main" class="container" tabindex="-1">
    <header style="margin-bottom: var(--kds-space-6);">
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--kds-font-mono); font-size: var(--kds-heading-32); color: var(--kds-text-primary);">Security Posture</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--kds-text-muted);">Technical overview of the security layers protecting the KOLINN infrastructure.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="security-grid">
      <section class="security-block">
        <h2>Edge Protection</h2>
        <p>Deployed on Cloudflare's global network, providing automatic DDoS protection and Web Application Firewall (WAF) filtering.</p>
        <ul class="security-list">
          <li>L3/L4 DDoS mitigation</li>
          <li>Automatic SSL/TLS termination</li>
          <li>Edge-side request filtering</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="security-block">
        <h2>Content Integrity</h2>
        <p>Strict Content Security Policy (CSP) prevents Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) by restricting where scripts and styles can be loaded from.</p>
        <ul class="security-list">
          <li>No inline scripts permitted (excluding theme boot)</li>
          <li>Strict domain allow-list for images and fonts</li>
          <li>No-sniff MIME types enforced</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="security-block">
        <h2>Client-Side Security</h2>
        <p>Minimal JavaScript footprint reduces the attack surface. All user input is treated as untrusted and sanitized.</p>
        <ul class="security-list">
          <li>Zero third-party JS dependencies</li>
          <li>Strict frame-denial (X-Frame-Options)</li>
          <li>Secure cookie handling for theme state</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .security-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--kds-space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .security-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .security-block {
    background: var(--kds-surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--kds-border-default);
    border-radius: var(--kds-radius-md);
    padding: var(--kds-space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--kds-space-3);
  }

  .security-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--kds-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--kds-title-20);
    color: var(--kds-text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .security-block p {
    font-size: var(--kds-small-14);
    line-height: var(--kds-lh-small-14);
    color: var(--kds-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .security-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--kds-space-1);
  }

  .security-list li {
    font-family: var(--kds-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--kds-caption-12);
    color: var(--kds-accent-subtitle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--kds-space-1);
  }

  .security-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--kds-status-success);
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
